    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64508.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "I'm so glad you're here. You have been a huge gift to me in many ways. And if you don't mind me just filling the audience in a little bit. You have been a comfort to our family as we lost our grandson, not terribly long ago. And your faith and your strength and your ability to pour into us has been so valuable and so meaningful. So thank you for that.",
