    "turn_text": "God gets the glory and you get the thanks for being willing to speak on behalf of what God's placed in your heart. And speaking of that, you actually wrote what was on your heart in a wonderful book called Raising Fathers. I love that book and I recommend it highly if you have a son getting ready to get married. It's a great wedding present if you have a couple that's in your life that's having their first child. It's a great time to give them this book. It is a powerful book on recouping from some things and giving really opportunity to other things.",
